// The one positional argument of a declaration with a path is the entry itself
// (`X.X` is `X`): `::blueprint.daily(@file(...))` registers a file under the
// name `daily`, and several positional arguments are a sequence, so
// `::workspace.ignore("target", ".git")` is `ignore: ("target", ".git")`.

